{"id":"678e4ae13575ec1c","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-correctness.md","title":"Correctness of the Book’s P.E. and P.A.","display":"thm-smullyan-correctness — Correctness of the Book’s P.E. and P.A.","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-correctness","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-correctness"],"display":"thm-smullyan-correctness — Correctness of the Book’s P.E. and P.A.","source":"第 III 章 pp. 28、30、36；第 IV 章 p. 49（PDF 45、47、53、66）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]","[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-correctness — Correctness of the Book’s P.E. and P.A."},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 28、30、36；第 IV 章 p. 49（PDF 45、47、53、66）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6511106aac2e96b7\" href=\"?note=6511106aac2e96b7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-truth\">92-df-smullyan-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>；可证关系采用有限证明。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Correct}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{Correct}_E\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_E\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6511106aac2e96b7\" href=\"?note=6511106aac2e96b7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-truth\">92-df-smullyan-truth</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(S\\vdash F\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Correct}_E(F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(S\\vdash F\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Correct}_E(F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：L1–L3 是命题重言式；L4 保持全称蕴涵，L5 用变量完全不出现，L6 用闭定值/赋值下项的见证，L7 用同值替换一个项树叶。N1–N11 在自然数的后继、加、乘、指数和通常序下逐条正确。</p>\n<p>固定其它自由参数时，IndInst 的底步是真正 F(0) 的等价包装，StepWrap 在任意当前值 n 处等价于 F(n+1)，因此元语言自然数归纳保证归纳实例正确。MP 保持正确性；Gen 从“在全部数码赋值下为真”推出全称正确性。最后对证明行数归纳。此论证使用标准自然数语义，不是系统在自身内部证明全局正确性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-truth","status":"resolved","id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-truth","status":"resolved","id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Correct}_E$ 与 $\\operatorname{True}_E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Correct}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\;\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(S\\vdash F\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Correct}_E(F)).","display":true}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 correctness 对开放公式指其全部数码实例为真；本文 Sound 只对可证闭句表述标准可靠性。原书原生 PE/PA 的全部公式正确性已见 [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。这一元语言性质不能当作系统内部可证的反射模式。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]、[[92-df-smullyan-induction]] → [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] → [[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。L7 采用完整变量叶的单出现递归；N12 采用原书双层量词包装。"},{"id":"eed9e6920706b864","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]"}],"outgoing":["7a63648901cbcd33","6511106aac2e96b7"]}